  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Right now in the open beta, controlling the scale of your avatar is done via a radial puppet. What I'd propose instead is changing it to a two-axis puppet (up/down). It'd make it easier to fine-tune the scale of your avatar as well as being the fact the further up or down you go on the axis, the faster you scale. Also would make scaling feel more natural with the up/down motion. With there being the fact we can easily reset our height in the expression menu now, I think the two-axis puppet would make the most sense UX wise.",
